File Index

/hudLayoutStore.ts
Purpose: Manages HUD layout mode preferences (classic or compact) stored in localStorage.

/hudThemeStore.ts
Purpose: Manages HUD theme preferences (default or slate-amber) stored in localStorage.

/hudWidgetRegistry.ts
Purpose: In-memory registry where plugins publish/clear content into named compact-HUD widget slots (ownership-checked clears, dispatches an update event).
